cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the FracVAL aggregation methodology, please cite the original
  Morán et al. paper. If you use FracVAL-Qt-specific functionality, also cite
  this repository and the release/version used.
title: FracVAL-Qt
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: GPL-3.0-only
authors:
  - name: FracVAL-Qt contributors
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  authors:
